{"title":"1997 JBMO Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Problem_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Problem_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Show that given any 9 points inside a square of side length 1 we can always find 3 that form a triangle with area less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5db9e227e8177d26de452c2a2faeb6d45cc53d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1#Solution\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 1\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/a/24a63c5e522a0f18baa66decc0046275a0659b4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2+y^2}{x^2-y^2} + \\frac{x^2-y^2}{x^2+y^2} = k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"178\" height=\"42\" />. Compute the following expression in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/9/c99e935bc847cdcaee76b4a8af84db262067eca7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[E(x,y) = \\frac{x^8 + y^8}{x^8-y^8} - \\frac{ x^8-y^8}{x^8+y^8}.\\]\" width=\"228\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2#Solution\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> be a triangle and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027f4a11d6090f9eac0ce2488df6384dad1263ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the incenter. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> be the midpoints of the sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/5/e657259c0995d2c36d46744bb4aa81471e6575ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CA$\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> respectively. The lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/b/35bb3f3bcadf5dc5c045b80fc24d014c0b969cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BI$\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/d/a8d37413bae1973358eebff164711f292d16be56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CI$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> meet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbcfabd65745f2b759dea1840f9a0753b2f992e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> respectively. Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b71e9f4603e1009e1babfcf334159c1bee80103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AI+BI+CI&gt;BC+KL$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"222\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3#Solution\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 3\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the triangle with sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> and circumradius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/7/5478099bcd3863bae28c44c61c856103811a42b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(b+c) = a\\sqrt{bc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"22\" />. \n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4#Solution\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 4\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/defbf06b987965438e5928b96688e48df84cba0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/c/85c5df946080fc6ec1ee0a560a8e8c5e6699113c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/3958e984d2597b35da7975f4503cdcf965a777f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ldots$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/4/a74b5d37373c0f9f3c0b0f76d9d5decd42d4f13c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_{1998}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> be positive integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/9/27994bc5861679d68c68e81da1b333f9770e3752.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n_1^2 + n_2^2 + \\cdots + n_{1997}^2 = n_{1998}^2.\\]\" width=\"228\" height=\"19\" /> Show that at least two of the numbers are even.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_5#Solution\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 5\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO\" title=\"1997 JBMO\">1997 JBMO</a></b> (<b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13_contests\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Olympiad</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_JBMO_Problems\" title=\"1998 JBMO Problems\">1998 JBMO Problems</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_JBMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 JBMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a><b></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JBMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\"> All JBMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018044103\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 164/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 864/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 64/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4218/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.062      1 Template:JBMO_box\n100.00%   10.062      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14315:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018044103 and revision id 243940. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}